ong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">JavaScript's <code class=3D"bg-t=
ext-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pr=
e-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">this</code> was designed =
theo C++ object model, nh=C6=B0ng JavaScript's functional nature made dynam=
ic binding problematic. Community needed <strong>lexical binding</strong> -=
 where <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 tex=
t-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]"=
>this</code> refers to enclosing scope.</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=94=AC B=E1=BA=
=A3n Ch=E1=BA=A5t &amp; Mechanism</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Core Algorithm Explanati=
on:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Arrow functions don't have their=
 own <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-=
danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">t=
his</code>, <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-30=
0 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9=
rem]">arguments</code>, <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 bord=
er-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-=
px text-[0.9rem]">super</code>, or <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border bord=
er-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4re=
m] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">new.target</code>. Instead, they:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Capture Lexical Context=
</strong>: Record <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-bor=
