>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Store Reference</strong=
>: Keep pointer to outer <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 bor=
der-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py=
-px text-[0.9rem]">this</code></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Forward Calls</strong>:=
 When invoked, use stored <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 bo=
rder-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 p=
y-px text-[0.9rem]">this</code> reference</li>
</ol>
