<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Problems v=E1=BB=9Bi Old=
 Syntax:</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Property Name Repetitio=
n</strong>: <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-30=
0 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9=
rem]">name: name</code> pattern everywhere</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Verbose Method Syntax</=
strong>: <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 t=
ext-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem=
]">methodName: function() {}</code> for every method</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>No Dynamic Property Nam=
es</strong>: Required separate assignment steps</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Poor Readability</stron=
g>: Hard to distinguish properties from methods</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Boilerplate Overhead</s=
trong>: Too much syntax noise</li>
</ol>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=94=AC B=E1=BA=
=A3n Ch=E1=BA=A5t &amp; Mechanism</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Core Algorithm Explanati=
on:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Enhanced object literals introdu=
ce several syntactic transforms:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Shorthand Properties</s=
trong>: <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 te=
xt-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]=
">{name}</code> transforms to <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.=
5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px=
-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">{name: name}</code></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Method Shorthand</stron=
g>: <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-d=
anger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">{m=
ethod(){}}</code> transforms to <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-=
0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] =
px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">{method: function(){}}</code></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Computed Properties</st=
rong>: <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 tex=
t-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]"=
>{[expr]: value}</code> evaluates <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border borde=
r-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem=
] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">expr</code> at runtime</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Super References</stron=
g>: <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-d=
anger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">su=
per.method()</code> calls parent method</li>
</ol>
