<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Lost Error Context</str=
ong>: Error information gets lost trong nested callbacks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>No Composition</strong>=
: Cannot easily combine async operations</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Debugging Nightmare</st=
rong>: Stack traces are meaningless</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Testing Hell</strong>: =
Mocking nested callbacks is extremely difficult</li>
</ol>
