<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=92=A1 Intuitive=
 Understanding</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Real-world Analogy:</str=
ong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Think of Promises nh=C6=B0 <stro=
ng>restaurant order system</strong>:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Order Placed (Promise C=
reated)</strong>: You place order, get receipt (promise object)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Pending State</strong>:=
 Kitchen is cooking, you wait with receipt</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Fulfilled</strong>: Foo=
d arrives, you get what you ordered</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Rejected</strong>: Kitc=
hen runs out of ingredients, order cancelled</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Then Chains</strong>: "=
When food arrives, add salt, then eat, then pay"</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Key insights:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Receipt (promise) represents fu=
ture food (value)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You can plan actions before foo=
d arrives (.then())</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">If something goes wrong, you ha=
ndle it (.catch())</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You can't change the order once=
 placed (immutable state)</li>
</ul>
