<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Real-world Analogy:</str=
ong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Think of ES6 modules nh=C6=B0 <s=
trong>modern library system</strong>:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Old Way (Pre-ES6)</stron=
g> - <strong>Chaotic Bookshelf</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Books scattered everywhere (glo=
bal namespace)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Manual tracking of which books =
you need (dependency management)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Hope books are in right order (=
script tag order)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Books might have same title but=
 different content (naming conflicts)</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>New Way (ES6)</strong> -=
 <strong>Digital Library System</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Each book has unique ID (module=
 specifier)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">System knows all dependencies u=
pfront (static analysis)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Automatic ordering (dependency =
resolution)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Live updates when source book c=
hanges (live bindings)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Only check out books you actual=
ly read (tree shaking)</li>
</ul>
